{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "tenmiye-backend-collection",
		"name": "Tenmiye Backend API",
		"description": "Complete Postman collection for Tenmiye Community Management System API\n\n## Features\n- All endpoints organized by domain\n- Pre-configured environment variables\n- Example request bodies\n- Auth token management\n- Error handling examples\n\n## Usage\n1. Import this collection\n2. Import the environment file (Tenmiye-Backend.postman_environment.json)\n3. Select the environment in Postman\n4. Start testing endpoints\n\n## Authentication Flow\n1. Register a user: POST /api/users/register\n2. Login: POST /api/users/login (saves token automatically)\n3. Use token for protected endpoints\n\n## Domains\n- Constants (System configuration)\n- Users (Phone + password auth)\n- Roles (Permission management)\n- Tiers (Membership levels)\n- Admins (Google OAuth)\n- Password Reset (Recovery flow)\n- Boards (Hierarchical structure)\n- Transactions (Financial records - IMMUTABLE)\n- Announcements (Community notices)\n- Elections (State machine)\n- Votes (Cast votes - IMMUTABLE)\n- Storage (File management)",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"auth": {
		"type": "bearer",
		"bearer": [
			{
				"key": "token",
				"value": "{{auth_token}}",
				"type": "string"
			}
		]
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Health Check",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Health Check",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/health",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
